    "name": "Magician Impossible",
    "steam_appid": 3808150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808150/extras/4858215c064e08ba21ad1996b99ae5d4.avif?t=1754081840\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casting spells</strong> and invoking magical incantations<strong> </strong><i>normally</i> requires <strong>years of formal training</strong> and countless permits <strong>(neither of which you have).</strong>    <br>  <br>You've found yourself in some hot water after causing a bit of an <strong>incident</strong>, now you're on the run from the law.\u00a0Use your unconventional magic to escape prison, cause <span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>minor</strong></span>\u00a0property damage, and prove that maybe wizard school <i><strong>is</strong>\u00a0</i>a scam after all!<br><br>Progress through a linear story across a <strong>series of</strong>\u00a0<strong>handcrafted levels</strong>, each introducing new spells and challenges as you work your way toward freedom. Discover <strong>hidden spells</strong>, steal magical gear, and find increasingly absurd ways to solve problems with magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Magician Impossible</u></strong> is a first person puzzle platformer with light combat and spellcasting mechanics. Players draw symbols with their wand to cast spells, solve environmental puzzles, and navigate 3D levels using movement abilities like <strong>grappling</strong> and <strong>flying</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808150/extras/455947924a6c6d60e6c724c65efb5cca.poster.avif?t=1754081840\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808150/extras/455947924a6c6d60e6c724c65efb5cca.webm?t=1754081840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808150/extras/455947924a6c6d60e6c724c65efb5cca.mp4?t=1754081840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw to Cast\u00a0</strong>- Cast spells by drawing shapes with your mouse in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong>\u00a0- Solve puzzles using creative spell interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Platforming</strong> - Jump, swing, slide and glide through platforming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; Theft</strong> - Evade detection and steal items using magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Magic</strong> - Use telekinesis to grab, throw, and launch objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Gear</strong> - Enhance your wand and broom with magical modifiers that boost spell power, improve mobility, or just make things look cooler.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong> - Combine all your spells and movement abilities to fight various bosses throughout the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goofy Story</strong> - A lighthearted tale that doesn't take itself too seriously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong> - A whimsical, handcrafted score composed by the developer to match every magical misstep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808150/extras/3a924ab4e968f6d3d4eb37edcc418980.poster.avif?t=1754081840\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808150/extras/3a924ab4e968f6d3d4eb37edcc418980.webm?t=1754081840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808150/extras/3a924ab4e968f6d3d4eb37edcc418980.mp4?t=1754081840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shapeshift</strong> - Squeeze through tight places or scurry past guards as a rat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808150/extras/8fb091838a8af49321bfb0071deb8d05.poster.avif?t=1754081840\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808150/extras/8fb091838a8af49321bfb0071deb8d05.webm?t=1754081840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808150/extras/8fb091838a8af49321bfb0071deb8d05.mp4?t=1754081840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing</strong> - Because why not?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808150/extras/5a1008465bdde1d18b4e77f9ac67cbc7.poster.avif?t=1754081840\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808150/extras/5a1008465bdde1d18b4e77f9ac67cbc7.webm?t=1754081840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808150/extras/5a1008465bdde1d18b4e77f9ac67cbc7.mp4?t=1754081840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
